{"seq":1,"slug":"hermes-memory-md-char-cap-and-format","title":"Hermes MEMORY.md 字符上限与格式","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/persistent-memory/hermes-memory-md-char-cap-and-format","wordCount":1053,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"hermes-memory-md-字符上限与格式\">Hermes MEMORY.md 字符上限与格式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Hermes 把&quot;跨会话长期记忆&quot;实现为单一可读文件 <code>~/.learnwy/hermes/MEMORY.md</code>，而非数据库 dump。文件本身是 Markdown，但 Hermes runtime 严格执行<strong>头部 200 行 / 25KB</strong> 的硬截断：每次会话启动时只把头部装进 system prompt，剩余条目通过 FTS5 检索按需召回。这套设计来自 Claude Code auto-memory 的工程经验，但比 Tier 1 多两层：<strong>importance-score 排序的可维护性结构</strong>，以及由 curator 进程自动重写头部的演进闭环。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[Session start] --&gt; B[Read MEMORY.md head]&#10;  B --&gt; C{head &lt;= 25KB?}&#10;  C -- yes --&gt; D[Inject into system prompt]&#10;  C -- no --&gt; E[Truncate to 200 lines]&#10;  E --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; F[Agent runtime]&#10;  F --&gt; G[memory_query via FTS5]&#10;  G --&gt; H[Tail entries by score]\">flowchart LR\n  A[Session start] --&gt; B[Read MEMORY.md head]\n  B --&gt; C{head &lt;= 25KB?}\n  C -- yes --&gt; D[Inject into system prompt]\n  C -- no --&gt; E[Truncate to 200 lines]\n  E --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; F[Agent runtime]\n  F --&gt; G[memory_query via FTS5]\n  G --&gt; H[Tail entries by score]</pre><p>四个区块构成 MEMORY.md 的物理结构：frontmatter 元数据 / body 条目正文 / importance 评分边带 / tags 索引侧栏。Hermes runtime 按这个固定布局解析，curator 按这个布局回写。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>区块</th>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>维护者</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>frontmatter</td>\n<td>文件头 YAML 块</td>\n<td><code>version</code> / <code>last_curator_run</code> / <code>entry_count</code></td>\n<td>curator</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>body</td>\n<td>YAML 之后的 H2/H3 段</td>\n<td>标题 + Markdown 正文</td>\n<td>用户 + curator</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>importance</td>\n<td>每条目末行 <code>&lt;!-- importance: 0.82 --&gt;</code></td>\n<td>0.0-1.0 浮点</td>\n<td>curator</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tags</td>\n<td>每条目末行 <code>&lt;!-- tags: project,bytedance --&gt;</code></td>\n<td>逗号分隔</td>\n<td>curator</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"200-行-25kb-双重截断\">200 行 / 25KB 双重截断</h2><p>为什么是 200 行同时 25KB 而不是单维度限制？因为 Markdown 单行可以长达数 KB（粘贴的 JSON 或 stack trace），单一行数限制会让一条 dump 占满预算；反过来单一 byte 限制对于密集要点排版又太松。Hermes 取 <code>min(行数 &lt;= 200, byte &lt;= 25KB)</code> 两个条件，谁先触达谁截断。</p>\n<p>实现层面，截断不是&quot;把后续条目删掉&quot;，而是<strong>保留 importance score 最高的 K 条</strong>，剩余条目挪到文件尾的&quot;cold storage&quot;段。Cold storage 段不进 system prompt，但仍被 FTS5 索引，<code>memory_query</code> 工具可以访问。这意味着低 importance 不等于丢失，只是不再&quot;白嫖&quot;上下文预算。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"---&#10;version: 2.4&#10;last_curator_run: 2026-05-13T03:00:00Z&#10;entry_count: 187&#10;hot_byte_size: 24317&#10;cold_byte_size: 86419&#10;---&#10;&#10;## 用户偏好：commit message 不带 Co-Authored-By&#10;&lt;!-- importance: 0.95, tags: workflow,git,bytedance --&gt;&#10;仓库 commit hook 会拒绝伪造 co-author trailer。Hermes 在 personal-agent&#10;模式下生成 git commit 时必须省略 `Co-Authored-By:` 行。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">last_curator_run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2026-05-13T03:00:00Z</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">entry_count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">187</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">hot_byte_size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24317</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">cold_byte_size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">86419</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">## 用户偏好：commit message 不带 Co-Authored-By</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">&#x3C;!-- importance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">0.95, tags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">workflow,git,bytedance --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">仓库 commit hook 会拒绝伪造 co-author trailer。Hermes 在 personal-agent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">模式下生成 git commit 时必须省略 `Co-Authored-By:` 行。</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"importance-score-计算\">importance score 计算</h2><p>每条条目的 importance 不是固定值，curator 周期重算。三个因子加权：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因子</th>\n<th>权重</th>\n<th>信号来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>recency</td>\n<td>0.3</td>\n<td>最近被 <code>memory_query</code> 命中或被用户引用的天数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>relevance</td>\n<td>0.4</td>\n<td>与活跃 persona / project 标签的 cosine similarity</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>user_signal</td>\n<td>0.3</td>\n<td>显式 pin / explicit <code>/memorize</code> / 用户更正频次</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>importance</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mtext>recency_days</mtext><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>0.4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>entry</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>persona</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>user_signal</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{importance} = 0.3 \\cdot \\sigma(\\text{recency\\_days}^{-1}) + 0.4 \\cdot \\cos(v_{\\text{entry}}, v_{\\text{persona}}) + 0.3 \\cdot \\text{user\\_signal}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">importance</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2084em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">recency_days</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">entry</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">persona</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">user_signal</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 是 sigmoid，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 是 embedding。新条目默认 importance=0.5，第一次 curator 跑过后才有 reasoned 分数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与-claude-code-auto-memory-对照\">与 Claude Code auto-memory 对照</h2><p>Tier 1 的 Claude Code 也有 auto-memory（<code>~/.claude/projects/&lt;slug&gt;/memory/MEMORY.md</code>），但是 session 级——每个 working directory 起一个独立文件，跨工程不共享。Hermes MEMORY.md 是 <strong>全局单实例</strong>，所有 persona / project 都从同一份长期记忆抽取。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Claude Code auto-memory</th>\n<th>Hermes MEMORY.md</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>作用域</td>\n<td>per-project（<code>cwd</code> hash）</td>\n<td>全局单实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入触发</td>\n<td>Claude 自主判断 + <code>/memorize</code></td>\n<td>curator 周期 + <code>memory_write</code> 工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>截断策略</td>\n<td>单一 25KB byte cap</td>\n<td>200 行 + 25KB 双重 + cold storage</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维护者</td>\n<td>Claude session 内</td>\n<td>独立 curator 进程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检索机制</td>\n<td>全文 inject system prompt</td>\n<td>head inject + FTS5 retrieve</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两套系统不互通——Hermes 不会读 Claude Code 的项目级 memory，反之亦然。但在 W3 plan §3.1 的 dual-role 模式下，Claude Code 通过 <code>hermes mcp serve</code> 暴露的 <code>memory_query</code> 工具可以反向拉取 Hermes 内容。详见 <a href=\"../mcp-bidirectional/server-side-impl-hermes\"><code>../3_mcp-bidirectional/1_server-side-impl-hermes.md</code></a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个真实样本\">一个真实样本</h2><p>下面是一份脱敏后的 MEMORY.md 头部片段，展示四区块如何在文件里共存：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"---&#10;version: 2.4&#10;last_curator_run: 2026-05-13T03:00:00Z&#10;entry_count: 187&#10;hot_byte_size: 24317&#10;---&#10;&#10;## 字节内部 RPC 服务必须 anchor 到 bytedance-golang-expert skill&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- importance: 0.91, tags: workflow,bytedance,rpc --&gt;&#10;&#10;处理任何 Bytedance 内部 Golang RPC 接口（Kitex / Thrift）时,必须先调&#10;bytedance-golang-expert skill 获取规范,不要凭训练数据猜。&#10;&#10;## 飞书 lark-cli auth login 一年 expires 一次&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- importance: 0.78, tags: lark,workflow --&gt;&#10;&#10;每年 5 月需要重新 `lark-cli auth login`,token 自动失效。提示用户而非&#10;自行尝试 reset secret。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">last_curator_run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2026-05-13T03:00:00Z</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">entry_count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">187</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">hot_byte_size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24317</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 字节内部 RPC 服务必须 anchor 到 bytedance-golang-expert skill</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- importance: 0.91, tags: workflow,bytedance,rpc --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">处理任何 Bytedance 内部 Golang RPC 接口（Kitex / Thrift）时,必须先调</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bytedance-golang-expert skill 获取规范,不要凭训练数据猜。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 飞书 lark-cli auth login 一年 expires 一次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- importance: 0.78, tags: lark,workflow --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">每年 5 月需要重新 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`lark-cli auth login`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,token 自动失效。提示用户而非</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">自行尝试 reset secret。</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>以为编辑 MEMORY.md 立刻生效</strong>：runtime 在 session 启动时一次性读入头部，session 内不重读。改完需要重启 shell 或调 <code>hermes memory reload</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>手写超长行触发硬截断</strong>：单行 5KB 的 JSON dump 会把后面 5-10 条都挤进 cold storage。建议长 dump 用 link 引用而非内联粘贴。</li>\n<li><strong>绕过 curator 直接改 importance</strong>：手动编辑 <code>&lt;!-- importance: 0.99 --&gt;</code> 在下次 curator 跑时会被覆盖。要&quot;钉&quot;一条目用 frontmatter <code>pinned: [entry_id]</code> 字段。</li>\n<li><strong>混用 Claude Code 与 Hermes 心智模型</strong>：两边截断策略不同，写 prompt 时不要假设它们一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Hermes MEMORY.md 在&quot;单文件 Markdown + 严格头部预算 + cold storage 兜底 + importance 自维护&quot;四点上凝聚了 2026 personal-agent 工具栈对长期记忆的工程共识——不依赖向量数据库、不靠 RAG 重建上下文，靠 200 行硬约束逼用户和 curator 共同保持 signal-to-noise。Importance score 把&quot;哪些信息值得占预算&quot;的决策外化为可观测的浮点，curator 周期重排让记忆系统自身演进。下一篇看 OpenClaw 的&quot;三件套&quot;方案如何用三个独立文件分层取代 Hermes 的&quot;单文件四区块&quot;。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Hermes MEMORY.md 字符上限与格式","id":"hermes-memory-md-字符上限与格式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"200 行 / 25KB 双重截断","id":"200-行-25kb-双重截断"},{"level":2,"text":"importance score 计算","id":"importance-score-计算"},{"level":2,"text":"与 Claude Code auto-memory 对照","id":"与-claude-code-auto-memory-对照"},{"level":2,"text":"一个真实样本","id":"一个真实样本"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"OpenClaw 三件套：AGENTS + SOUL + USER","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/persistent-memory/openclaw-three-file-system"}}